Z||000000||David DeVoe||08-18-2001||10:28 AM||||Hi,<BR>I've got a question that I'm sure someone here can answer. My silver 86 SE has a red tape stripe just above the black ground effects. Was this stripe a factory option or did some doofus stick it on there thinking it would look cool? Any ideas on the best way to get rid of it if I decide it has to go?<BR>Thanks for any help<BR>Dave<BR>PS My undying gratitude to the folks who maintain this board. I've learned more about my car here than I ever would have without it.||||reg||1
Z||000001||hyhy4u||08-18-2001||10:35 AM||||Hmm..never heard of that option before..lol.. if its just tape, i would peal it off and get some adhesive remover, either that or WD40 Gets about anything off paint and it wont hurt it either..Good Luck!<P>-Jason.<P>P.S.- Just dont use anything that will take off paint!, lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
